 "section_summary": "This section contains the end of one compilation of intercepted commercial messages, an April 19, 1944 Embassy despatch forwarding another compilation, and the beginning of that enclosure. The messages concern wartime rice purchases, shipping, import permits, industrial equipment, finance, insurance, personnel and trade across Japan, French Indochina, China and Southeast Asia. The enclosure also includes private messages and requests for reporting on political developments.",
